{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_043380","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你知道Nessie吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"姑且知道。那么有名，不知道才少见。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那就好说了。Snake也觉得那是存活下来的恐龙吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也许吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"一本<R=同志,COMPA>送我的书里有照片。和蛇颈龙的复原图简直一模一样。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=同志,COMPA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……为什么只有尼斯湖里有幸存下来的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"据说是因为那里后来与海洋隔绝了。尼斯湖还和海相连时，有蛇颈龙游了进去，之后因为气候变化之类的原因被困在湖里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":162,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那里又没有作为天敌的<R=哺乳动物,MAMMAL>，所以它们才一代代繁衍，一直活到了现在。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=哺乳动物,MAMMAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那其他湖里有也不奇怪。只要环境相似。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"没错。所以Nahuelito、Ogopogo之类的巨型生物，才会在各个湖里被目击到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我不知道Irazú有没有……但<R=尼加拉瓜湖,LAGO COCIBOLCA>里肯定有什么东西。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=尼加拉瓜湖,LAGO COCIBOLCA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}